ful pick-ups to aid your journey. Utilise <strong>Portals</strong> to bank your items and backtrack to recover loot you left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/extras/5b78c3ceefdd294b48f7b42452e8091b.poster.avif?t=1774164097\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/extras/5b78c3ceefdd294b48f7b42452e8091b.webm?t=1774164097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/extras/5b78c3ceefdd294b48f7b42452e8091b.mp4?t=1774164097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "This adventure pits a lone explorer against the dangers of a strange underground world while blending classic 2D platforming with heart-pounding twin-stick shooting. Embrace the fun and excitement as you jump, shoot, and dash your way through to restore the severed link to the surface", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/header.jpg?t=1774164097", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774164097", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774164097", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual core from Intel or AMD at 2.8 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 450 GTS / Radeon HD 5750 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<